    "detailed_description": "Trial of the Brave is an action-style Rogue game. Players can control different types of powerful characters. Each character has its own skill combos, and there are nearly a hundred types of effect card attributes that can be matched to create various genre effects. .<br>Battle system\u3011<br>    There are currently 4 characters in the game (more characters will be updated in the future). Each character has 4 different skills and basic attack, block, <br>    teleport and retreat.<br>    You can pick up props during the battle. Defeating the BOSS will reward you with cards with attribute bonuses. Study the skills of various characters, match <br>    talents with attribute cards, and deal explosive damage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648360/extras/75019cfbc411b3d89d6d187a02f722e6.poster.avif?t=1741941481\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648360/extras/75019cfbc411b3d89d6d187a02f722e6.webm?t=1741941481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648360/extras/75019cfbc411b3d89d6d187a02f722e6.mp4?t=1741941481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>    Perfect Block: See through the enemy's attack and block at the moment of the enemy's attack. It is regarded as a perfect block and you can block and <br>    counterattack.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648360/extras/705575564b455c932696e8803bf97e9f.poster.avif?t=1741941481\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648360/extras/705575564b455c932696e8803bf97e9f.webm?t=1741941481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648360/extras/705575564b455c932696e8803bf97e9f.mp4?t=1741941481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>    Perfect teleportation: Avoiding enemy attacks will trigger bullet time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648360/extras/46016b5174589bed591f00d0e6c607fe.poster.avif?t=1741941481\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648360/extras/46016b5174589bed591f00d0e6c607fe.webm?t=1741941481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2648360/extras/46016b5174589bed591f00d0e6c607fe.mp4?t=1741941481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
